{"id":"51e24c83f9ce8f44","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-decidable.md","title":"Decidable Theory","display":"thm-decidable — Decidable Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-decidable","aliases":["58-thm-decidable"],"display":"thm-decidable — Decidable Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-decidable — Decidable Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,T\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,T\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\omega\\times\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(\\Phi:\\omega\\times\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,n)=\\Phi_e(n)\">\\(\\Phi(e,n)=\\Phi_e(n)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\Sigma,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\to\n(\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\downarrow\\land\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\n(\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)=1\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in T))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\Sigma,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\to\n(\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\downarrow\\land\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\n(\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)=1\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in T))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pressburger arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb{Z}, +, &lt;)\">\\((\\mathbb{Z}, +, &lt;)\\)</span> is decidable.</li>\n<li>The theory of real closed fields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb{R}, +, \\cdot, &lt;)\">\\((\\mathbb{R}, +, \\cdot, &lt;)\\)</span> is decidable.</li>\n<li>Natural number arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb{N}, +, \\cdot)\">\\((\\mathbb{N}, +, \\cdot)\\)</span> is undecidable (Gödel).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,T\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V$ and $\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]], [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V$ and $\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]], [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi:\\omega\\times\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega$, $\\Phi(e,n)=\\Phi_e(n)$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\omega\\times\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(e,n)=\\Phi_e(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\Sigma,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\to\n(\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\downarrow\\land\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\n(\\Phi_e(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)=1\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in T))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathbb{Z}, +, <)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb{R}, +, \\cdot, <)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb{N}, +, \\cdot)","display":false}],"bytes":1518,"backlinks":[{"id":"d6250dd7b599c526","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-decidable.md|58-thm-decidable]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["90ce6acf0c65af45","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","af73296236e5df83"]}